{"data":{"id":"ORD_Ne2SAu0","slug":"dr-mad","title":"Dr. MaD","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"YyARckxtHAc","slug":"special-way-slum-village","title":"Special way (Slum Village)"},{"id":"fR50juTkADA","slug":"special-way","title":"Special way"}]},"markers":[{"id":"OevIjnPZnL8","position":56,"timestamp":"01:41:15","rawTrack":"Dr. MaD - Special way (Slum Village)","track":{"id":"YyARckxtHAc","path":"/artists/dr-mad/tracks/special-way-slum-village/","slug":"special-way-slum-village","title":"Special way (Slum Village)","artist":{"slug":"dr-mad","title":"Dr. MaD"},"artwork":"images/artists/dr-mad/tracks/special-way-slum-village.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"ymbEftQiGo8","slug":"all-day-2020","tags":[19],"links":{},"state":"published","title":"Soulection All Day 2020","artwork":"/images/episodes/soulection-all-day-2020.jpg","content":"\n**🎊🌟 Happy New Year 2020 🌟🎊**\n\nA day of exclusive mixes from [Joe Kay's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#joe-kays-set), [Sasha Marie](/episodes/all-day-2020/#sasha-maries-set), [Budgie](/episodes/all-day-2020/#budgies-set), and [Skinny Macho](/episodes/all-day-2020/#skinny-machos-set) to bring in the new decade. \n<!--more-->\n\n#### Jump to:\n\n- [Joe Kay's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#joe-kays-set)\n- [Sasha Marie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#sasha-maries-set)\n- [Budgie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#budgies-set)\n- [Skinny Macho's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#skinny-machos-set)\n\nAlso listen to [Soulection All Day 2019](/episodes/all-day-2019/).\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2020-01-01T14:41:45+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"ltJ1uUX23Wg","position":53,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Dr. MaD - Special way","track":{"id":"fR50juTkADA","path":"/artists/dr-mad/tracks/special-way/","slug":"special-way","title":"Special way","artist":{"slug":"dr-mad","title":"Dr. MaD"},"artwork":"images/artists/dr-mad/tracks/special-way.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"vPfL7UzxY4Y","slug":"139","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-139-w-dj"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #139 w/ DJ Harrison","artwork":"/images/episodes/139.jpg","content":"DJ Harrison thows down a crazy live improvised session with the SP-404 and MPC1000\n\n<!--more-->\n\noe Kay started off with some nice deep/melodic tracks from Mr. Carmack, Christoph El Truento, Dirg Gerner, Iamnobodi, Sango, Last Night In Paris, Geode and many more! Joe took it back to the essence with Ginuwine/Timbaland/Dilla classics! DJ Harrison on the other hand who reminds us of Madlib (no really he does)all the way from Virginia threw down a crazy live session with the SP-404 & MPC 1000. Lots of soulful chops and intricate drum patterns! This is another amazing session from start to finish! Spread this if you feel it.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10810,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-03T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"gVQOM73Zmxw","position":8,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Dr. MaD - Special Way","track":{"id":"fR50juTkADA","path":"/artists/dr-mad/tracks/special-way/","slug":"special-way","title":"Special way","artist":{"slug":"dr-mad","title":"Dr. MaD"},"artwork":"images/artists/dr-mad/tracks/special-way.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"liNF_Uad_x0","slug":"151","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-151-w-mr"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #151 w/ Mr. Choc (Beat Junkies)","artwork":"/images/episodes/151.jpg","content":"\nFor this week's special guest if you want to talk about pioneers in the game [Mr. Choc](https://twitter.com/MrChocFan4) is one of them. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nOne of our favorite DJ's who's talent and accomplishments are not to be overlooked. \nRepresenting the world famous Beat Junkies crew and Skam Artists, the crew was blessed to have this man come by Kbeach and hit us with a set and great interview session. \nThe thing we admire the most about Choc is that he has his ears close to the new generation of music and understands the culture. \nHe threw down a really diverse set and kept us on our toes. \n\nJoe Kay was on his soulful chop vibe and has really been digging back into the classic neo-soul/boombap sound. \nMake sure you really pay attention to the interview at the end. \nSome great insight on commercial radio on the west coast as well as opportunities for upcoming DJ's. \n\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10812,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"jYem02AVPAQ","position":30,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Dr. MaD - Special way","track":{"id":"fR50juTkADA","path":"/artists/dr-mad/tracks/special-way/","slug":"special-way","title":"Special way","artist":{"slug":"dr-mad","title":"Dr. MaD"},"artwork":"images/artists/dr-mad/tracks/special-way.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"my3sd-7c2Ss","slug":"198","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-198"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #198","artwork":"/images/episodes/198.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10851,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-12-20T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"yDzw_Slo0uY","position":5,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Dr. MaD - Special way","track":{"id":"fR50juTkADA","path":"/artists/dr-mad/tracks/special-way/","slug":"special-way","title":"Special way","artist":{"slug":"dr-mad","title":"Dr. MaD"},"artwork":"images/artists/dr-mad/tracks/special-way.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"CPZZR2IUlUI","slug":"226","tags":[6,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radi